      "autoClaim:1": 0,
      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The convergence. One Steam Mineral Logistics Cluster running its seven-unit chains on hub steam; a quantum-anchored ME network storing everything in infinite cells; wireless covers moving every watt; info walls and the machine ledger watching it all; and a cat-signed receipt for 2 shimmering coins on the counter.\n\nEvery strand of this zone physically meets here: GTSR's steam and singularities, GTSWN's wireless telemetry, GTIT's wallet. That was the whole point of the crossover — not three mods in one pack, but one industry with three heartbeats.\n\nBeyond this gate the challenge zone will ask for 32 banked criticals and 300 percent engineering, and the exchange zone will take your surplus. The complex is ready. Are you?",
